In that shape-guide I linked to, it looks like point-shapes 15-20 have a fill, but they don’t — they’re always solid black. So change the 15 in this line to a number between 21 and 25 and you should be good:

guides(fill = guide_legend(order = 2, override.aes = list(shape = 15, size = 9)), shape = guide_legend(order = 1))
​

